  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Cut the Gammelost cheese into 1-inch (2.5 cm) cubes.",
    "Thread the cheese cubes, fresh thyme, and a few slices of garlic onto skewers.",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil and sprinkle with lemon zest, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Cook the skewers for 4-5 minutes per side, or until golden brown and crispy.",
    "Remove from heat and garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve immediately with a side of your favorite keto-friendly vegetables.",
    "Enjoy!"
